nformation about your proposed project\", sent through the foundation's portal; stage two is a full proposal if invited."},{"where":"funders/new-york-community-trust/unsolicited_note","excerpt":"On its donor-advised funds it says \"We cannot refer you to donors\"."},{"where":"funders/cleveland-foundation/typical_grant","excerpt":"Request the amount that meets the needs of your program.\"; grants are generally for one year."},{"where":"funders/home-depot-foundation/what_it_funds","excerpt":"On 2026-10-04 its grants page listed three programmes: Veteran Housing Grants, Retool Your School and Path to Pro Grants."},{"where":"standing/donor-advised-fund-sponsor/for_grant_seekers","excerpt":"The New York Community Trust tells applicants \"We cannot refer you to donors\"."},{"where":"help/candid-search/related","excerpt":"candid-near-you-locator"},{"where":"help/find-local-united-way/what","excerpt":"United Way Worldwide says \"Most program funding happens locally, so we encourage you to reach out to your local United Way to learn more\"."},{"where":"mechanics/samhsa-notice-six-steps/what","excerpt":"FY 2026 SAMHSA notices are laid out in six steps (Review the Opportunity; Get Ready to Apply; Build Your Application; Learn About Review and Award; Submit Your Application; Learn What Happens After Award)."}],"consolidation_report":["programs/nsf-research-proposal","programs/doj-nij-research-evaluation","programs/acf-csbg","programs/hrsa-cpf-cds-projects","programs/bwf-career-awards-medical-scientists","funders/dod-onr","funders/templeton-foundation","funders/new-york-community-trust","funders/cleveland-foundation","funders/home-depot-foundation","standing/donor-advised-fund-sponsor","standing/federated-fund","gates/imls-egms-reach","help/nih-program-official","help/nih-matchmaker","help/find-your-caa","help/hrsa-cds-program-mailbox","help/onr-indirect-cost-branch","help/imls-egms-reach-help-desk","help/candid-community-partners","help/national-council-of-nonprofits","help/can